Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 20:31:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Reconstruct fork children on every Tool path

Route subscribed inject, subscribed tail-inject, and unsubscribed plain fork through one child Tool/thread-state reconstruction path. Add regressions for the previously bypassed tail and unsubscribed cases.
